# Two defs on one line: a def's end is known only by line, so a call on
# that line may be in either def or after both, and is pinned to neither —
# footer was freed by build, which never calls it. header, inside build,
# names no caller either: that is the cost of the rule (DEC-751).
dead app Report#header=single-caller^ Report#footer=single-caller^ Report#build=unreferenced^ Report#run=single-caller^
